&lt;li&gt;Own the design and documentation of key business metrics, ensuring clarity and consistency across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify trends, anomalies, and opportunities in data and share insights with stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Data Engineering and Analytics Engineering to ensure data models meet reporting needs and support self-service analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the development of team-wide best practices for visualization, dashboard UX, and storytelling with data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create training, documentation, and data literacy resources to enable others to access and interpret data effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in sprint planning and help shape the BI roadmap by identifying high-value projects and recurring requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and teach data-savvy stakeholders and serve as a subject matter expert in the BI toolset and analytics best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
