&lt;li&gt;Advanced SQL skills and comfort working directly with raw tables to produce clean, performant queries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intermediate Python skills to model and analyze raw tables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with one or more modern BI tools (e.g., Power BI, Tableau, Looker).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong data visualization and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about helping others understand and use data to drive better decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in cloud platforms (Azure, AWS, GCP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with dbt or dimensional modeling concepts is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with healthcare, telehealth, or regulatory data (e.g., HIPAA) is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in agile, cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
